@nsobid-51A5F17583DE73E0038772960B42E091

# Splatoon 2 March 28 2017 prototype - 2560x1440 resolution

@flag print_values
@flag offset_shift 0x100

// Forces the render/scan-buffer resolution to 2560x1440 (native 1280x720).
// Patches Lp::Sys::ISysInitCstm::getScanBufferSize (the packed WxH scan-buffer constant).
// MEMORY: total heap arrangement ~2760 MB against the ~2.9 GiB the default
// 4 GiB DRAM Size gives the game -- it fits, but with little slack left for the
// engine's 'cOthers' heap. If boot aborts with a heap failure, raise
// Ryujinx > System > DRAM Size to 6 GiB.

@enabled
001FAC60 09B4C0D2
001FAC64 094081F2
// Pin the 2D/UI virtual canvas to 1280x720 instead of letting it follow the
// scan buffer (Lp::Sys::ISysInitCstm::getVirtualCanvasSize). The HUD/menu layouts
// in this build are authored in 720p units, so a canvas that grows with the
// resolution leaves the UI drawn at its original pixel size in a corner of the
// frame. Later builds hardcode 1280x720 here; this restores that behaviour.
001FACB8 08A08052
001FACBC 0001271E
001FACC0 085A8052
001FACC4 0101271E
001FACC8 1F2003D5
// Enlarge the fixed dynamic-texture GPU pool so Depth-of-Field / post-effect
// buffers fit at this resolution (Cmn::GfxMgr::getDynamicTextureAllocatorMemSize, 64 MB -> 256 MB).
// Without this the game aborts in agl::utl::DynamicTextureAllocator::alloc_ (pool exhausted).
000B7344 0000A252
// Enlarge the graphics heap partition (Cstm heap arrangement mGfxSize) so the bigger
// dynamic-texture pool above can actually be carved from it (132 MB -> 576 MB). Without this the
// game aborts at boot in agl::Initialize -> DynamicTextureAllocator::initialize (heap too small).
001F1838 0A80A452
// Enlarge the system heap partition (Cstm heap arrangement mSysSize, 180 MB -> 384 MB).
// Every Lp/Cmn manager task carves its heap out of whatever is left of this heap, so
// once the higher resolution eats into it the tasks created last get nothing -- seen on
// the March builds as "heap create failed. [Coconut]" in Cmn::CoconutMgr::prepare.
001F1834 0900A352
@stop

// Resolution/LOD technique derived from Fl4sh9174's retail Splatoon 2 5.5.x mods.
// Dev-build offsets reverse-engineered against the Cstm/Lp engine
// (Lp::Sys::ISysInitCstm::getScanBufferSize / nn::gfx SamplerImpl::Initialize).
//
// https://github.com/RAMDRAGONS/switch-patches
